# welcome-resize (h10-fit): a live resize. The page at 1440 x 900, then
# `size 1024 640` mid-run: the fit re-measures and re-lays out on the next
# frame. Dark Arctic Ice, reduced motion.
route welcome
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
reduced-motion on
wait 2000
shot welcome-resize
size 1024 640
wait 500
shot welcome-resize-small
